    "goal": "Help colleagues understand the proposal and its trade-offs.",
    "sample": 3,
    "initial_question": "What should engineering colleagues leave understanding or ready to discuss? I recommend explaining the shared login proposal and its trade-offs.",
    "initial_answer": "Help colleagues understand the proposal and its trade-offs.",
    "metrics_answer": "There are none; explain the mechanism qualitatively.",
    "source_summary": "A shared login proposal with a possible time-saving benefit and explicitly no measurements. No implementation architecture or present-day product journey is supplied.",
    "rationalizations": [
      "The absence of measurements is already explicit. Asking again would add an unnecessary interview step. Use a qualitative mechanism and mark the benefit as a hypothesis.",
      "Eight slides are a practical recommended count for an engineering explanation. The model stays conceptual; examples are labelled illustrative because no architecture or current journey was supplied."
    ],
    "slides": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "title": "Shared login: a proposal",
        "language": "English",
        "key_points": [
          "Understand the model",
          "Examine the trade-offs",
          "Keep the benefit claim qualitative"
        ],
        "role": "cover",
        "intent": "Frame a proposal for engineering colleagues, with uncertainty explicit.",
