        },
        "visual_elements": {
          "main_visual": "Large title at left; restrained account icon connected to three service icons at right."
        },
        "required_images": [],
        "notes": "We are considering a shared login model. I want to explain the experience it could create and the engineering trade-offs that sit behind it. The possible time saving is a hypothesis; we do not have measurements yet.\n\nI will use an illustrative journey to make the mechanism concrete, then separate the account model from the questions we still need to answer."
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "An illustrative access journey",
        "language": "English",
        "key_points": [
          "Open one service and sign in",
          "Move to another service and sign in again",
